WEBVTT

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.020
I knew it... we never should have entered Glast Heim.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.690
We were in way over our heads!

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.700
Roan. We'll get out of this.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.060
Don't give up.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.030
I won't.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.340
The gate! I see the gate!

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.640
Just a little further.
Hang in there, Yuufa!

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.980
Right...

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.710
Big Brother Keough! Look!

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:03.220
Keough-<i>san</i>!

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.560
You three make a run for it!

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.530
B-But!

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:07.000
Big Brother Keough!

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.000
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.400
I'm right with you!

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.040
Iruga, take the two of them with you!

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.340
--But...
--Quickly!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.080
Forgive me...

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.340
Big Brother!

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.980
What?

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:27.780
Wait! My brother is-

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.820
Go Yuufa!

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:31.340
I beg you to let me go!

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:43.430
Nooo! My brother! My brother!

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:44.690
Big Brother Keough!

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:51.010
Why're you closing the gate?!
Big Brother's still back there!

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.210
Yuufa...

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.410
No! Let me go!

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:57.040
Big Brother's still inside!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.480
No!

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.760
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.730
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.230
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:18.730
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:24.540
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:28.480
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.580
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:43.890
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:49.430
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:56.560
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:02.040
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.480
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:11.420
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.690
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:17.760
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.260
<i>You are my star</i>

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:30.610
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:33.510
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:55.130
Done...

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.690
Well done, Roan.

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.030
Heal!

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:05.960
Thank you, Yuufa.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.450
One... two... three.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.310
Roan, look!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.320
Huh? Geffen Tower!

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.590
We're almost there.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:28.800
Wow! I'm so glad I came with both of you!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.600
You sure took your time, though.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.070
That's why we should've asked Kapra.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.240
--No!
--Oh no!

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.910
It'd have cost us big time!

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.480
If we did, this wouldn't be an adventure!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.580
That's what you say, but...

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:44.410
--Any complaints?
--Any complaints?

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:48.940
Err... No complaints...

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.930
We finally made it...

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.460
But doesn't something seem wrong?

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:16.180
Wow! Customers galore!
Time to work!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.410
I'm open for business, everybody-
--Everyone! I'm here to heal you...

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.640
Huh? Wait a minute...

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:27.660
Heal! Heal! Heal!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.590
Heal! Heal! Heal! Heal!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.150
Heal! Heal!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.970
She's obstructing business!

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:40.800
What's the matter?

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.640
I'm going to stock up...

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.470
--What was that about?!
--Heal! Heal!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.510
Huh? What's the matter, Devin?

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.280
I'll tell you what's the matter...

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.620
Can't you tell?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.890
You're closing shop, right?

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.320
But why? Isn't it too early?

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:06.950
Nowadays, everyone stays locked up at home after dusk. See?

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:14.040
So you see, I can't sell a thing.
That's why I close up.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.410
You folks should stay at home, too.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.040
We don't have a home.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:19.910
Huh?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.880
Then go to an inn.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:25.310
We'll go, but sell me some goods first!

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.820
Sorry, come back again tomorrow.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:28.980
See ya.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.350
We'll be back bright and early at sunrise.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.480
Come back then!

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:41.990
What is with all of you?!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.940
So that is where you are...

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.270
...ghostly souls.

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:54.740
Ghosts?!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.440
Poring...

00:06:56.440 --> 00:07:01.380
Yes. Every night, eerie sounds can be heard from Geffen Tower....

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:06.880
Many search parties have gone in to investigate, but...

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.290
As a result, we've had no vacancies every day,

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.660
so in that regard, we're thankful, but...

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:20.620
But if the rumor spreads and people stop coming to Geffen...

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:43.320
Okay! Let's expose the Geffen ghosts!

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:49.630
I'm afraid of ghosts and that sort...

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:52.830
But... If we slay the ghosts,

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.800
the people of Geffen will be grateful to us.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:08:00.540
An acolyte should do things to make people happy.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.580
You're right!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.810
Making people happy is what an acolyte does!

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:05.750
Okay then!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.920
Tomorrow we take Geffen Dungeon!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.520
Right!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.390
It's my chance to stock up on lots of recuperative items...

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.290
Business is looking up!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.830
Another massacre...

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.960
How terrible...

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:25.770
We'll be fine!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.570
We'll expose those ghosts,
I just know it!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:30.140
Uh... okay...

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:33.630
Are you planning to enter
Geffen Dungeon?

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.810
Hey! I'm right here!

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.150
The dog talked!

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:42.420
Wow! How unusual!
Can I make it my pet?

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.890
Cut that out! I'm not a dog!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:47.460
What's the matter, Miss Maria?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.190
Oh, Catherine... help me out.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:54.360
These people plan on entering Geffen Dungeon.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.630
Funny dog...

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.330
Fetch!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.500
Are you two a couple?

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.570
Huh?

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:08.270
No, we're not. We're just friends from childhood.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:17.220
Anyway, are you seriously planning to enter Geffen Dungeon?

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:21.890
You're in over your heads! Even senior search parties were massacred.

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:24.190
Is something the matter?

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.830
That voice...

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.000
I knew it was you, Takius!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.030
Oh, it's you...

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.330
What?

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:34.570
It's been so long, Takius...

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:35.870
When did you return?

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.910
I just arrived a short while ago.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.810
So, why're you with these children?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:44.310
They say they're going to sneak into Geffen Dungeon.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:50.020
I see... I was planning on going into Geffen Dungeon myself.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.150
Really?!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.790
I will look after these children.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.660
We'll be better off with more people...

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.390
I'm sure they won't do anything rash if you're with them, but...

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:03.800
What're you saying?!
I won't allow it!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.700
Who... who is that?

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:06.870
Takius.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.470
We met in Prontera.

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:11.610
The three of us defeated the clock tower manager monster.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:15.940
Awesome! How do you do?

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:20.450
I'm Maaya, a merchant!
You can call me Ma-<i>chan.</i>

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:24.290
Please feel free to use my magical items!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:25.690
No, thank you.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:28.260
Huh? I see...

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.990
Ask me any time.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.690
Not very friendly...

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:48.310
I'll take two of the white, a blue one, and... and...

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:52.040
And maybe butterfly wings for our escape?

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.050
That's...

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:03.220
We need to talk.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.190
Okay...

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:08.700
Can we leave her off our party?

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.330
Huh? Why?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.030
I'd like to know why, too.

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:14.800
She's dangerous.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:18.110
She has a different objective in mind.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.480
It'd be unwise to have such a person in our party.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.340
Who did you say is dangerous?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.280
I was talking about you.

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:30.920
Your presence would endanger these children.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:32.390
Don't be silly.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:36.760
I've been a big help to both of them.

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:38.020
Now, now...

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:46.900
Takius, relax...

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.370
You, too, Maaya.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.320
Wait for me!

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.730
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.760
So you are coming, after all.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:18.830
Naturally. Right?

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.400
Huh? Uh... yeah...

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.570
Let's all try to get along, okay?

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:26.510
The more the merrier, you know?

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.000
Is that so?

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.310
You insist on going?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:36.010
You're all fools.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:43.350
Bye.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:52.030
Go! Go! Go!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.100
She's still wearing that blindfold...

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:57.640
Yes.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:01.040
Meaning she hasn't left him yet...

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:16.650
Yuufa!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.090
Yay!

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.260
Are you all right?

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.990
Yes, thank you!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.530
Come on, we must hurry.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:27.660
Right.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.590
Not bad, eh?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.620
Oh!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.020
Splendidly done.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:51.160
But you must not let down your guard.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:55.360
There's no monster that might appear that I can't handle.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.030
Watch me.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.700
You mustn't go unprepared!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.640
I'll be fine!

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.970
Damn!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.990
Look out!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.320
Lightning...

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.330
...Bolt!

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.500
I was a bit off my game there...

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:44.180
I'm sure that's all it was.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:46.380
Eat this, and better luck next time.

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:49.980
The further we go, the stronger the monsters will become.

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:53.120
From here on in, let's use the strategy we used last time.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.990
All right.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.190
What should Ma-chan do?

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:00.360
You stay here and suck on candy or something.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.330
Here comes another.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:06.630
Right.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:18.970
Roan!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.980
Cold Bolt!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:28.790
Are you all right, Roan?

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.660
Thank you, Yuufa.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.650
You did it, Big Bro!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.990
Here, carrot juice!

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:41.100
We have no time to rest.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.570
Let's go.

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.660
Right!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:50.140
Uh... this is boring!

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:53.340
I can't sell anything, so maybe I'll just go back.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.160
Roan!

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.190
Yuufa, add acceleration!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:06.960
Right!

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.620
Thank you!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.970
Thunder...

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:19.670
Storm!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.750
Roan, are you okay?

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.250
Yeah!

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:33.920
This is nothing...nothing at all!

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.650
Roan, behind you!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:38.980
Huh?!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.000
Why you-

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:52.670
Dammit!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:56.980
It's useless! Your attack won't work on Whispers!

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.080
Frost...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.340
...Diver!

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.250
Let's make our escape while we can.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.050
Huh?! But-

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:10.420
He's right. We haven't come across any rare items yet!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:13.090
Our lives are more important than rare items!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.290
Let's go!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.790
It seems we're too late.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:26.110
Roan! Yuufa-<i>san</i>!

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:28.610
I'm going to use magic!
Cover me!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.630
Right!

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:42.820
Yuufa!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:45.990
Hang in there!
Soon Takius will-

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.660
T-Takius!

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:54.170
Takius!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.800
Get ahold of yourself, Takius!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.970
Poison... I've been bitten with poison!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.340
What?!

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:03.930
Oh no!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.160
Huh?! No!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.600
Roan! Roan!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:22.960
Yuufa!

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.030
Don't come near me!

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:29.540
Roan... Yuufa!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.740
Roan!

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:32.300
No!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.780
Maaya!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.310
Maaya...

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.600
Maaya?

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.930
Maaya!

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:11.980
Yuufa... Takius...

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.610
Maaya...

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.720
Huh?

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.820
Roan...

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:25.390
Huh?! Yuufa!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.490
Roan, are you okay?

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:29.760
Yeah, but I can't move.

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:30.760
How about you?

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:34.300
I'm fine, but Takius...

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:34.960
Huh?

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:39.640
Takius!

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:42.630
Roan... you've come to?

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:46.380
I didn't think Maaya would run away...

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.710
I'm sorry.

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:52.190
This wouldn't have happened if only I had listened to you...

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:56.060
No... in the end,
I allowed her to come.

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:57.890
It isn't your fault.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.890
But why did she-

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:02.960
She joined our party to sell recuperative items and collect rare items.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:07.370
If it became dangerous she intended to run away....

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.970
She is one of many such unscrupulous merchants.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:12.370
That's not true!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:14.740
Maaya's not that kind of girl!

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:15.980
What're you talking about?!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:19.510
She left us here and ran off, didn't she?!

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:22.680
Well... she must've done it for a reason.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:27.150
Sometimes we want to avoid seeing the truth.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:30.190
But there is only a single truth, and we mustn't run from it.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:33.680
No! I... I believe!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.700
Stay away! Stay away!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.370
Go, Poi-Poi!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:54.950
Poring! Poring!

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:57.380
Big Bro, use this!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.530
Ow... this is...

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.830
...a Fire Sword!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:10.630
It has the power of fire, so it can kill ghosts!

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:12.230
Here goes!

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:13.670
Go!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.980
Are you all right, Big Bro?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.450
Thank you, Maaya.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:28.280
You left us to get that sword, didn't you?

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.280
You should've told us first...

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.520
We thought you had run away.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.350
Sorry!

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.100
We're out!

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:53.610
Yuufa, I'm fine now...

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:54.700
All right.

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:59.010
I thank you for saving me.

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:01.650
But... why did you return?

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:04.850
Search me... I could've just left you there.

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:10.310
It seemed like a good idea to ingratiate myself to someone who hates me.

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:16.660
I'm going to challenge them again!

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:17.760
Big Bro...

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:18.400
Huh?

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:21.940
I paid for the Fire Sword for you, so be sure to pay me back.

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:22.770
What?!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:24.970
Not "what?"!

00:22:24.970 --> 00:22:26.340
But-

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.310
<i>This is Vritto from Kapra Service.</i>

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:36.480
<i>Roan burns with a desire to avenge</i> <i>what happened in Geffen Dungeon..</i>

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:39.350
<i>With Fire Sword in hand,</i> <i>no one can stand in Roan's way!</i>

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:40.480
<i>But...</i>

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.150
<i>Next time:</i> <i>"Is That the Best You Can Do?"</i>

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:45.680
<i>Join us again, okay?</i>
